Design real-world objects with parametric 3D modelling

FreeCAD is a parametric 3D modeller for designing real-life objects of any size. Because designs keep their history, you can change a model by editing the parameters it was built from.

- Parametric modelling with an editable model history
- Constraint-based 2D sketches as the base for 3D parts
- Production drawings generated from 3D models
- Extensible with workbenches and Python macros
